{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_05",
  "title": "月光",
  "storyCode": "LE-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "41f56e60d7350f84f5563727fe0207ca1d4edba452bf6335432ffaba97a2b5d4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你現在感覺怎麼樣，沒問題了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒問題的，一定沒問題的。你和我都會沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我出去一會兒，你好好在這兒待著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才剛好一點，這是要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......去辦事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管什麼事，都等到你恢復再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用擔心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉也說了，如果醒了，最好休息一段時間，觀察一下情況......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是急事，很急的事，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我們離音樂會已經沒多長時間了。我覺得現在最重要的還是把身體養好，加緊練習......這也是你的願望啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在就別拿這個煩我了，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我確實非去不可，別攔著我了。我會儘快回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的......不能告訴我要去做什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果一切順利的話......你會知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "衣服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "約好今天下午去取的，我沒法陪你去了，你自己去一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "記得帶大提琴，試穿的時候試著拉一小段，看看會不會有不舒服的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來請求您停辦這次音樂會，至少不要讓黑鍵和白堊在音樂會上合奏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果讓黑鍵和白堊合奏，夕照區會出大事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按你的說法，我最近身體好轉，是因為黑鍵和白堊引發的所謂“假癒”，但假癒期一過去，我就會變成重症患者，命在旦夕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，您和他們接觸很多，因此症狀也更明顯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他和他們接觸較少的人也會受到影響，如果放任他們合奏，很可能有人死去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。雖然原因尚不明確，但讓這兩個人在一起合奏，有很大可能增強他們對周圍的影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多大可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "暫時還不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了我，還有誰會因此面臨生命危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......夕照區的十多人已經被送去高庭區的醫院了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "高庭區......也就是說，他們已經離開了黑鍵和白堊的影響範圍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "應該是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白你的意思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不奢求您取消整場音樂會，但就算單獨把黑鍵和白堊合奏的曲目撤了也好！或者換人也可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你能證明他們的合奏一定會導致我以外的人受害，我立刻就取消這場音樂會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但現在不同，連你也無法得知合奏的後果究竟是什麼。我不能僅僅因為虛無縹緲的“擔憂”，就讓整個夕照區的努力和希望付諸東流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "整個夕照區的努力和希望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我理解您對這次音樂會的重視程度，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的理解，就不會輕飄飄地說出那個“但是”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾，我不能僅憑你的一面之詞改動音樂會的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "車爾尼先生，請您直接告訴我，這次音樂會和感染者的生命相比，究竟重要在什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是想說我漠視生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "芙蓉，芙蓉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "烏爾蘇拉婆婆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走，和我出去吹吹風，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾蘇拉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出去冷靜一下，然後再說也不遲，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（如果格特魯德說的全部都是真的，白堊不可能活下來......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，一定有什麼辦法的......兩全其美的辦法......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（車爾尼，車爾尼說不定能知道什麼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不，他只是個音樂家，他幫不上忙的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我要不要告訴白堊實情——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（可那又有什麼用呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（羅德島......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（芙蓉那種人，只會讓我回烏提卡繼續坐牢！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（女皇之聲？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我到底在想什麼，自殺計畫嗎？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不行，我一直在這兒兜圈子，實在太可疑了。我得換個人少的地方......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嗯？那人有點眼熟。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_492_1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......謹慎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_488_1$1",
